    <briefdescription>
<para>File header structure (31 bytes fixed size). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Layout:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>magic[6]: &quot;STARDS&quot; magic string (6 bytes)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>format_version: File format version (1 byte, currently 1)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>header_size: Total size of header + index section (8 bytes)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>entry_count: Number of entries in the index (8 bytes)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>layer_count: Number of named layers, excluding <bold>base</bold> (4 bytes)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>key_registry_count: Number of keys in the global key registry (4 bytes)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Note: Software/library version is NOT stored in the file, only the format version. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
